{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_05",
  "title": "拙山",
  "storyCode": "WR-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c8ba6945779afe9046ef748d2d6ff5a8ce5014b6666e92c68c4d5b1034c6aeb5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......那位女性叫什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "不知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "没问过？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "也不敢呐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "再说那如梦似幻，如真似假，兴许是一年半载，又或是弹指一瞬，恍神之间，这上哪儿问去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧游历炎国，有意无意回想起这个故事，细细想来，兴许只是住持爷爷敷衍我而胡乱编的故事罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "不过小僧在炎国四处打听，这幅《拙山尽起图》竟然还小有名气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "相传是一位约百年前的无名画家所留，曾有皇亲国戚重金求而不得，因此闻名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "正巧到了灰齐山附近，小僧便突发奇想，想借机去看看是否能找到那画中的奇景......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "哈哈，在山中寻到一处山清水秀之地，反应过来时，就已经身在此处啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "灰齐山上的那栋茅屋，这倒是和我们如出一辙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......这里会是一场梦吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "如是一场大梦，那对施主来说，小僧便是梦中幻象，那小僧说的话，也就不可信了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "若是不可信了，炎熔施主又如何判断眼前的景色，是梦非梦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "慢点......你要把我绕晕了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那你知道怎么离开这里吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧云游至今，仍未明白如何主动离开此地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......至今？你在这里呆了多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "很久很久啦，细细数来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "二位的茶就要凉了，别光顾着说话，品一品茶吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊......谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（呼......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......嗯？说起来，黎小姐，难道也是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "只是本地的当铺掌柜罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "炎熔小姐......我很欣赏你的善良，也很钦佩你从墨魉手下保护镇民的意愿，但有时候，请多考虑一下自己的安危。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那些怪物对罗德岛的精锐构不成威胁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "此话不假，炎熔施主一身好本领，无需担心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......若真是如此，也好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "炎熔小姐，我有一个问题，不知当不当问。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "问吧，其实不用对我们这么拘谨的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "炎熔小姐，你可端详过水中的月亮？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "无论水中月色会被粼粼波光扯碎成什么模样，待到风平浪静时，它还会是那轮圆月。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "若是因为怜悯那一时闪烁的水中月色，因此湿了鞋，着了凉，是大没有必要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "炎熔小姐，你可会为了捞那一轮水中月......费尽心思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不......应该不会？做这种事儿没什么意义吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎么突然说这个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......我不知炎熔小姐的那轮明月是何模样，也就无法提醒炎熔小姐到底差在何处。不过水中月，终归是水中月罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "没必要为了我们，做到这个份上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你是说......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "恩人！恩人！你没事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......啊呀，连茶都泡上了，居然不喊我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "这二位想必也是婆山镇的贵客吧？我去泡茶，顺路拿些糕点，你们慢叙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "那位是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是这里的掌柜，名字叫黎，黎明的黎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "恩人，那些墨魉呢？哦哦，我知道了！一定是恩人神威无敌，把它们全都赶跑啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "——那个小女孩安全了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "她安全了，没事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "呜呜呜，恩人呐，你怎么如此不信任我......我趟过刀山火海也未流泪的，现在倒是有几分心酸......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "二位，茶水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "嗯嗯......闻着就感觉到是很昂贵的茶叶呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "恩人好见识！像我这种凡夫俗子，只觉得苦，完全尝不出滋味哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "只是寻常茶叶罢了。镇上集市，只有卖这一种茶叶，若是不合意，还请见谅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "呼啊~虽然习惯了红茶和咖啡，但是偶尔品一品大炎的茶叶，也别有一番滋味嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧家乡也有堪称别具滋味的茶叶，若是有机会，请务必让小僧小露一手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "呼啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "哎呀，小炎熔，你犯困了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "没有。只是突然放松下来罢了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "茶水养心，几位劳烦的事情，不是靠奔波劳累就能解决的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......还是没什么线索啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "在这画中天地，只能慢慢来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "对了！嵯峨，你见过这个东西吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧并不知晓......只是不知为何，小僧总觉得曾在某地见过此物......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "真的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "待小僧想想......唔......这个纹理......此般材质......究竟是在何时何地见识过呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "茶水反射的光......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "唔哦哦！？发生什么了？怎么突然都站起来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "......天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "天亮了......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "这、这些东西怎么靠近这里的！？这里可是午时街啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "不、不对，天边......太阳怎、怎跑到那边去了？鸿洞山发生了什么！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "啊啊啊！这些东西，在，在吃人——！快跑，快跑啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "text": "......逝者如斯夫，日升月落，理当如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "text": "呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "text": "......扰吾清静......是她的意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......这、这是什么情况？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "为什么太阳会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "——太阳本来就该这样哦，小炎熔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯？啊，这我当然知道啊，我只是在想怎么突然恢复正常了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "等等，对啊，这才是正常的......我刚才是怎么想的......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "二位恩人，我怎么觉得镇子那方向，这么热闹呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "救命——救命！救——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你没事吧！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我、我没事，原来你们在这儿，真是太好了，太好了！那些怪物突然不怕阳光啦!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "它们正在镇子上，吃、吃、吃......吃人啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
